+### cinecam_RegisterAssets
+
+| | |
+| --- | --- |
+| Syntax | `cinecam_RegisterAssets` |
+| Where | The **editor only** - it lives in `CinematicCameraEditor.dll`, not in the engine plugin. |
+| Purpose | Registers every `.cube`, `.cdl` and `.cinegrade` under `Assets/cinecam/` that the Asset Browser does not know about yet, by writing that one file's `.cryasset`. Prints how many it registered. |
+| Why you should not need it | The editor watches `Assets/cinecam/` and does this per file as soon as one appears, and sweeps the folder once at start-up for anything copied in while it was closed. The command is the manual fallback for a file-system event that never arrived (a network share, an unpacked archive). |
