-//   * a `.cube` (or `.cdl`, or `.cinegrade`) copied into the project gets its `.cryasset` written
-//     for it, because CAssetGenerator registers a file-monitor listener per registered extension
-//     whose CanAutoRepairMetadata() is true (AssetGenerator.cpp:151-179) and RC's metadata
-//     compiler has a generic fallback for any extension it does not special-case
